{"id": "sdqa0108", "pool": "sdqa", "tier": "balanced", "audio_s": 4.39, "n_chunks": 5, "n_concurrent": 5, "gen_active_at_eot": true, "eot_score": 0.4337, "eot_read_ms": 31, "reference_answer": "1955", "query": "When was Tylenol introduced?", "transcript": "When was Tylenol introduced?", "mode": "local", "answer": "Once upon a time a small dragon lived in a quiet valley beside a slow green river. Every morning the dragon would wake up stretch its tiny wings and yawn widely enough to fill the sky. It would then hop onto a rock by the river and watch the water flow gently past. The other animals in the valley were used to the dragon's quiet mornings and went about their own business without much notice.", "answer_ms": 2749}
